<title>USA: Calif. Dept of Water yields 5.28 pct in 2028.</title>
<headline>Calif. Dept of Water yields 5.28 pct in 2028.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber said Wednesday it repriced California Department of Water Resources $334 million deal. The top yield at the repricing was 5.28 percent in 2028.</p>
</text>
